show "===== COLLECTION TESTS ====="

set numbers as [5,2,8,1,9]

show numbers

append 10 to numbers
show numbers

remove 2 from numbers
show numbers

sort numbers
show numbers

reverse numbers
show numbers

count 8 in numbers as total
show total

filter numbers > 5 as big
show big

map numbers * 2 as doubled
show doubled

join numbers with "," as joined
show joined

split joined by "," as split_numbers
show split_numbers

show "===== TEST COMPLETE ====="
